---
description: WeftOS harness board and work loop
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the WeftOS dashboard board as the authoritative tracker for work in this
repository. On each work turn, run `node scripts/metaharness/crosscut.mjs` and
`node scripts/dashboard-board.mjs ready`. Before editing for a ticket, run
`node scripts/dashboard-board.mjs claim <ticket UUID|WEFT-N>`. Record findings
with `note`, and close with `done` including shipped work, commit, and test/build
evidence. Create new work with a stable source key and acceptance criteria.

Imported Plane IDs remain references only. Project boards such as Shasta,
BakeOS, and Sansone retain authority for their own tickets. Follow AGENTS.md
and docs/guides/agent-harness-triple-loop.md for the full contract.
